{
    "title": "Fazer Watch Face",
    "description": "\u2605\u2605\u2605 Watch Face for WearOS with new WatchFace Format \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n\r\nThis is free version and it is not customizable. You can explore the design with the free version to see if you like it. For full customization options, you can find the full version on the phone app or tap \"Unlock Premium\" on the watch face to be directed to the Fazer Premium Watch Face Play Store page!\r\n\r\nTransform your smartwatch into a powerful and stylish tool with Fazer Premium, the ultimate Wear OS watch face designed for those who demand more from their wearable technology. Crafted with precision and elegance, Fazer Premium offers a perfect blend of functionality and aesthetics.\u231a\u2728\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Customizable Design: Choose from various color schemes and display options to match your style. Fazer Premium allows you to personalize your watch face to suit your preferences.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 5 Complications: Adjust up to four complications to display the information most important to you.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd00 2 Shortcuts: Customize two shortcuts for quick access to your favorite apps and features.\r\n\r\n<b>Keywords:</b>\r\nWearOS, smartwatch, watch face, time display, weather updates, battery status, hydration tracker, step counter, cryptocurrency tracker, dual time zones, event notifications, customizable design, premium watch face.\r\n\r\n\u2605<b>Compatibility:</b>\u2605\r\n\r\nCompatible with all WearOS smartwatches.\r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>FAQ</b> \u2605\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n<b>How do I install the watch face on Wear OS</b>\r\nInstall it from Google Play Wear Store on your <b> watch. </b>\r\n\r\n<b>The watch face CANNOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, ..) or any other OS except WearOS </b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained \u2605\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605\u2605\u2605 Watch Face for WearOS with new WatchFace Format \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br><br>This is free version and it is not customizable. You can explore the design with the free version to see if you like it. For full customization options, you can find the full version on the phone app or tap &quot;Unlock Premium&quot; on the watch face to be directed to the Fazer Premium Watch Face Play Store page!<br><br>Transform your smartwatch into a powerful and stylish tool with Fazer Premium, the ultimate Wear OS watch face designed for those who demand more from their wearable technology. Crafted with precision and elegance, Fazer Premium offers a perfect blend of functionality and aesthetics.\u231a\u2728<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customizable Design: Choose from various color schemes and display options to match your style. Fazer Premium allows you to personalize your watch face to suit your preferences.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 5 Complications: Adjust up to four complications to display the information most important to you.<br><br>\ud83d\udd00 2 Shortcuts: Customize two shortcuts for quick access to your favorite apps and features.<br><br><b>Keywords:</b><br>WearOS, smartwatch, watch face, time display, weather updates, battery status, hydration tracker, step counter, cryptocurrency tracker, dual time zones, event notifications, customizable design, premium watch face.<br><br>\u2605<b>Compatibility:</b>\u2605<br><br>Compatible with all WearOS smartwatches.<br><br>\u2605 <b>FAQ</b> \u2605<br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br><b>How do I install the watch face on Wear OS</b><br>Install it from Google Play Wear Store on your <b> watch. </b><br><br><b>The watch face CANNOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, ..) or any other OS except WearOS </b><br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained \u2605<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
